<title>SPAIN: Cantabrico says 1996 ordinary profit up 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Cantabrico says 1996 ordinary profit up 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity firm Hidrocantabrico said on Friday that ordinary profit rose 14 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>The figures were contained in a statement acknowledging the work of outgoing executive deputy chairman Jose Luis Baranda.</p>
<p>Hidrocantabrico said group income generated in 1996 was more than 30 billion pesetas and investments totalled over 9 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>No further details were given, and no-one was available at the company to comment.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
